<article class="about-page shell"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Engineering intelligent systems for the real world.</h1><div class="about-copy"><p>Raj Shukla is a software architect, Generative AI engineer, and technical author focused on building dependable production systems with .NET, C#, and Azure.</p><p>His work spans distributed systems, AI agents, agentic workflows, context engineering, and the architecture needed to make Generative AI observable, durable, and useful beyond the prototype stage.</p><p>Raj is the author of the <em>Building AI Agents with .NET</em> series, which translates emerging agent patterns into practical engineering approaches for the Microsoft ecosystem.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/rajshukla09" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">GitHub</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rajshukla09/" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a></p></div></article>
